  "evidences": [
    {
      "id": "ev_1",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Evidence-Aurora-Supply-Chain-Attack-CCleaner-Part2(10-02-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s1"
      },
      "text": "Since my last post , we have found new evidence in the next stage payloads of the CCleaner supply chain attack that provide a stronger link between this attack and the Axiom group.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_2",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Evidence-Aurora-Supply-Chain-Attack-CCleaner-Part2(10-02-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 1,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p1_s2"
      },
      "text": "After uploading the different binaries to Intezer Analyze™ , the final payload (that I have access to) had a match with a binary relating to the Axiom group.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_3",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Evidence-Aurora-Supply-Chain-Attack-CCleaner-Part2(10-02-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 2,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p2_s1"
      },
      "text": "Related APT17 samples:",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_4",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Evidence-Aurora-Supply-Chain-Attack-CCleaner-Part2(10-02-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 3,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p3_s1"
      },
      "text": "Not only did the first payload have shared code between the Axiom group and CCBkdr, but the second did as well.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_6",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Evidence-Aurora-Supply-Chain-Attack-CCleaner-Part2(10-02-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 4,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p4_s1"
      },
      "text": "The stage two payload that was analyzed in this report (dc9b5e8aa6ec86db8af0a7aa897ca61db3e5f3d2e0942e319074db1aaccfdc83), after launching the infected version of CCleaner, was dropped to only a selective group of targets, as reported by Talos.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_13",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Evidence-Aurora-Supply-Chain-Attack-CCleaner-Part2(10-02-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 16,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p16_s1"
      },
      "text": "The value is then XOR decrypted by 0x31415926 which gives you 0x5A093B0D or the IP address: 13.59.9.90 Conclusion:",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
      "id": "ev_14",
      "evidence_type": "report_text",
      "report_id": "Intezer_Evidence-Aurora-Supply-Chain-Attack-CCleaner-Part2(10-02-2017)",
      "locator": {
        "page": 16,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p16_s2"
      },
      "text": "Considering this new evidence, the malware can be attributed to the Axiom group due to both the nature of the attack itself and the specific code reuse throughout that our technology was able to uncover.",
      "language": "en",
      "confidence": 0.95,
      "note": "narrative sentence evidence",
      "source": "document"
    },
    {
